{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Heartbreaking Yuri Tale of Love and Loss</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years ago, Ann Sakura\u2014your girlfriend\u2014vanished without a trace. Now, high school student Ran Ibuki is trapped in a derelict forest school where classmates are being brutally murdered. To escape and reunite with Ann, Ran must unmask the killer... and harness a desperate new power: rewinding time after every death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But each loop reveals darker secrets. Can you save everyone\u2014or will the truth destroy everything?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rewind Time, Change Fate</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die and rewind: Return to before each murder with clues intact, altering events to prevent deaths. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deduce the killer: Interrogate suspects, spot inconsistencies, and connect clues across timelines. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings: Your choices shape the story\u2014uncover the full truth through replays.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trust No One in This Psychological Horror</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deceptive classmates: The sweetest friend or popular idol could be the psychopath. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mind-bending twists: Vanishing rooms, haunting footsteps, silkworm cocoons trapping you... Is it real, or a hallucination? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep yuri romance: Piece together Ran and Ann's emotional bond amid the terror.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1398740?t=1767076298","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1398740?t=1767076298","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1398740/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767076298","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1398740/capsule_